(2015,0,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2015,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2015,0,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2017,0,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2017,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2017,0,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2018,0,0,'A fine trophy your head will make, $R.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Bloodfeather Sorceress'),
(2018,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $R.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Bloodfeather Sorceress'),
(2018,0,2,'You will be easy prey, $C.',14,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Bloodfeather Sorceress'),
(2018,1,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2018,1,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2018,1,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2019,0,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2019,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2019,0,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2020,0,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2020,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2020,0,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2021,1,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2021,1,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2021,1,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50.0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(2077,0,0,'You\'ll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Melithar Staghelm'),
(2079,0,0,'I\'m sorry, Huntress. None of our new $cs are ready. They still have much to learn.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Ilthalaine'),
(2079,1,0,'You\'ll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Ilthalaine'),
(2081,0,0,'Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban\'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Sentinel Kyra Starsong'),
(3514,0,0,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100.0,2,0,0,'Tenaron Stormgrip'),
(3514,1,0,'Take with you the blessing of the wind\'s embrace. May it make your descent from Aldrassil more... direct.',12,0,100.0,1,0,0,'Tenaron Stormgrip'),
(3519,0,0,'Mist! I feared I would never see you again! Yes, I am well, do not worry for me. You must rest and recover your health.',12,7,100.0,0,0,0,'Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak'),
(3569,0,0,'Kill!!!',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Bogling'),
(3569,1,0,'%s rises from the soil!',16,0,100.0,1,0,0,'Bogling'),
(6909,0,0,'I know you are there, rogue. Leave my home or join the others at the bottom of the world tree.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Sethir the Ancient - Near player'),
(6909,1,0,'The end of days is upon us! May the earth embrace my flesh and bones.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Sethir the Ancient - On Waypoint 14'),
(6909,2,0,'Filth! Filth everywhere! The forests must be cleansed!',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Sethir the Ancient - On Waypoint 5'),
(6909,3,0,'It is hopeless. Cutting one down results in two new growths.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Sethir the Ancient - On Waypoint 14'),
(15384,0,0,'A Guardian of Icecrown enters the fight!',41,0,100.0,0,0,0,'OLDWorld Trigger (DO NOT DELETE)'),
(34756,0,0,'Shh! Someone\'s here.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Moriana Dawnlight'),
(34757,0,0,'Don\'t get me wrong... I\'m grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Doranel Amberleaf'),
(49477,0,0,'I fear time may not be on our side, Ilthalaine. The battle may carry to Teldrassil itself if we do not act soon.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Huntress Sandrya Moonfall'),
(49478,0,0,'We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49478,1,0,'Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,0,0,'Iverron\'s poison is cured, but it will take some time for him to recover.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,1,0,'Shadowthread Cave lies to the north. Be careful, it\'s dangerous there of late.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,2,0,'The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,3,0,'The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49480,0,0,'You\'ve come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,0,'The corruption goes much further than these spiders. I fear the true source is not within this cave.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,1,'His body screams for death, but his soul',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,2,'I weep at these atrocities we commit. It is almost unbearable.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,3,'Corruption this deep could not have come from outside.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,4,'It almost seems as if he was born with this corruption inside of him.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,5,'They are surely unredeemable, but it still hurts to see them die.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,6,'The corruption is buried deep within him.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,2,0,'This totem has been corrupting the eggs! It seems a greater threat looms. The Gnarlpine remain tainted by something most foul.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,3,0,'My dear friends... I\'m sorry..',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,4,0,'I\'m going to stay and do what I can to free these spiders. Thank you for your help, $n.',12,0,100.0,0,0,0,'Tarindrella');
